     "t": "Yahia loves sports! Do you know when to say play, do, and go?"
    },
    {
     "e": "🏀",
     "t": "We say play with sports that have a ball or a game: play football, play basketball, play tennis."
    },
    {
     "e": "🥋",
     "t": "We say do with individual activities and martial arts: do karate, do judo, do yoga."
    },
    {
     "e": "🏊",
     "t": "We say go with activities that end in -ing: go swimming, go running, go cycling."
    },
    {
     "e": "🏄",
     "t": "At the weekend, Yahia goes swimming and plays football with his friends."
    },
    {
